    fix(a11y): resolve SQA-20 accessibility defects and complete retesting
    Corrected missing accessible labels on API endpoint and defect management forms.
    
    Improved API URL and CSV export text contrast to meet WCAG AA requirements.
    
    Fixed vertically stretched severity badges.
    
    Completed SQA-20 retesting with 16/16 Chrome and Edge technical checks passing.
    
    Verified 136/136 automated .NET tests passed.
    
    Preserved original SQA-20 FAIL evidence and added before/after accessibility results.
    
    Documented the pre-existing numeric endpoint validation failure found during HTTP regression testing.
    
    Preserved SQA-18 and SQA-19 evidence and limitations.

